TI  - Towards Human-AI Deliberation: Design and Evaluation of LLM-Empowered Deliberative AI for AI-Assisted Decision-Making
AU  - Ma, Shuai
AU  - Chen, Qiaoyi
AU  - Wang, Xinru
AU  - Zheng, Chengbo
AU  - Peng, Zhenhui
